<title>PAKISTAN: National Power raises KAPCO stake to 36 pct.</title>
<headline>National Power raises KAPCO stake to 36 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Kot Addu Power Co (KAPCO) said on Monday that it sold a fresh 10 percent stake to Britain's National Power for $76 million.</p>
<p>KAPCO said that with the new purchase National Power had raised its stake to 36 percent.</p>
</text>
